  "notes": [
    "CN3 contains no GND terminal. External controller and motor power supply need a common ground through another connection.",
    "U5 pin 2 is connected to NSLEEP. Pin 1 is NC and pin 3 is connected to 3V3. This is verified from a 600x440 high-resolution crop.",
    "U1/U2 SP and SN are directly grounded; no shunt resistor or current detection is present.",
    "For each driver, VREF and IDRIVE connect directly to that driver AVDD, not to the external 3V3 zener supply.",
    "The only net named DVDD in the source is the left driver DVDD annotation. Right DVDD remains a separate physical rail.",
    "Q1-Q8 are assigned identifiers for MOSFET symbols originally without reference designators.",
    "C7, C14, R2, R3, R4, R6, U3, U4 are not present in the PDF.",
    "Rev B adds TPS25910 main high-side eFuse input VM_RAW; P2.1 is the only original component pin whose net changed.",
    "Original input bypass, zener, enable switch U5 and all motor-driver components remain downstream of switched VM.",
    "SW1 is the main supply control; U5 still controls both DRV8701 nSLEEP inputs.",
    "New C18 nominal/effective capacitance selection must satisfy the exact part DC-bias requirement at 12V."
